<p><a href="<?= $link('/addons') ?>">← All add-ons</a></p>
<div class="notice">Action1 reads organizations and devices only. It does not deploy patches, run scripts or change Action1 devices. Sync runs in batches while this page is open. You can stop and resume later.</div>
<?php if(!$curlAvailable): ?><div class="notice error">The Action1 add-on requires the PHP cURL extension. Ask your hosting provider to enable it.</div><?php endif; ?>
<div id="action1-progress" class="notice" role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden></div><button type="button" id="action1-stop" class="button secondary" hidden>Stop after current batch</button>
<div class="two-columns"><section class="card"><h2>Connection settings</h2><form method="post" action="<?= $link('/addons/action1/save') ?>" autocomplete="off"><?= $csrf ?><label class="checkbox"><input type="checkbox" name="enabled" value="1" <?= $settings['enabled']?'checked':'' ?>>Enable Action1 add-on</label><label>Action1 region<select name="region"><option value="us" <?= $settings['region']==='us'?'selected':'' ?>>United States — app.action1.com</option><option value="eu" <?= $settings['region']==='eu'?'selected':'' ?>>Europe — app.eu.action1.com</option></select></label><label>Client ID<input name="client_id" maxlength="512" autocomplete="off"></label><label>Client secret<input name="client_secret" type="password" maxlength="4096" autocomplete="new-password"></label><p class="help"><?= $settings['configured']?'Credentials are stored encrypted. Leave both fields blank to keep them; enter a replacement secret to rotate it.':'Create credentials in Action1 under Configuration → Users & API Credentials, using a role that can read the organizations and endpoint data you want to import.' ?></p><p class="help">One Action1 account per installation. After mapping organizations, the region and client ID are fixed to prevent tenant mixing. Disabling the add-on stops sync without removing imported documentation.</p><button class="button">Save settings</button></form></section>
<section class="card"><h2>Test and discover</h2><p>Save settings first, then test API access and load the Action1 organization list.</p><form method="post" data-action1-run action="<?= $link('/addons/action1/test') ?>"><?= $csrf ?><button class="button secondary" <?= !$settings['enabled']||!$curlAvailable?'disabled':'' ?>>Test connection</button></form><form method="post" data-action1-run data-next="<?= $link('/addons/action1/discover-step') ?>" data-reload="1" action="<?= $link('/addons/action1/discover-start') ?>"><?= $csrf ?><button class="button" <?= !$settings['enabled']||!$curlAvailable?'disabled':'' ?>>Load organizations</button></form><?php if(!$settings['catalog_complete']&&$settings['catalog_generation']>0): ?><form method="post" data-action1-run data-next="<?= $link('/addons/action1/discover-step') ?>" data-reload="1" action="<?= $link('/addons/action1/discover-step') ?>"><?= $csrf ?><button class="button secondary" <?= !$settings['enabled']||!$curlAvailable?'disabled':'' ?>>Continue loading organizations</button></form><?php endif; ?><?php if($settings['last_error']): ?><p class="notice error"><?= $e($settings['last_error']) ?></p><?php endif; ?><p class="help">Requests are paced across the add-on. Rate-limit delays are honored automatically. Keep the page open until the operation finishes.</p></section></div>
<section class="card"><h2>Map organizations</h2><p>Choose which existing SimpleMSPDoc organization receives each Action1 organization's devices. Names are never matched automatically.</p><?php if($settings['catalog_complete']&&$organizations&&$settings['enabled']): ?><form method="post" action="<?= $link('/addons/action1/map') ?>"><?= $csrf ?><div class="form-grid"><label>Action1 organization<select name="external_organization_id" required><?php foreach($organizations as $remote): ?><option value="<?= $e($remote['external_id']) ?>"><?= $e($remote['name']) ?> (<?= $e($remote['external_id']) ?>)</option><?php endforeach; ?></select></label><label>SimpleMSPDoc organization<select name="organization_id" required><?php foreach($localOrganizations as $local): ?><option value="<?= $e($local['id']) ?>"><?= $e($local['name']) ?></option><?php endforeach; ?></select></label></div><input type="hidden" name="active" value="1"><button class="button" <?= !$localOrganizations?'disabled':'' ?>>Save mapping</button></form><?php else: ?><p class="muted">Enable the add-on and load the complete organization list first. Create any local organizations you need under Organizations.</p><?php endif; ?></section>
<section class="card"><h2>Sync mappings</h2><p>New configurations are internal only and use the Action1 managed endpoint template. Sync owns its Action1 fields; local names, notes, categories, tags, visibility, references and extra fields are preserved. It does not delete missing devices or restore archived configurations. Existing manually created configurations are not automatically merged by name.</p><?php if(!$mappings): ?><p>No organization mappings yet.</p><?php else: ?><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>Action1 → organization</th><th>State</th><th>Last completed sync (UTC)</th><th>Actions</th></tr></thead><tbody><?php foreach($mappings as $mapping): ?><tr><td><?= $e($mapping['remote_name']??$mapping['external_organization_id']) ?><br>→ <a href="<?= $link('/organizations/'.$mapping['organization_id']) ?>"><?= $e($mapping['local_name']) ?></a></td><td><?= $e($mapping['active']?$mapping['status']:'Disabled') ?><br><?= $e($mapping['processed_count']) ?> processed; <?= $e($mapping['skipped_count']) ?> archived skipped<?php if($mapping['last_error']): ?><p class="notice error"><?= $e($mapping['last_error']) ?></p><?php endif; ?></td><td><?= $e($mapping['last_sync']??'Not yet') ?></td><td><?php if($mapping['active']): ?><form method="post" data-action1-run data-next="<?= $link('/addons/action1/sync-step') ?>" data-reload="1" action="<?= $link('/addons/action1/sync-start') ?>"><?= $csrf ?><input type="hidden" name="mapping_id" value="<?= $e($mapping['id']) ?>"><button class="button small" <?= !$settings['enabled']||!$curlAvailable?'disabled':'' ?>>Sync now</button></form><?php if(in_array($mapping['status'],['running','error'],true)): ?><form method="post" data-action1-run data-next="<?= $link('/addons/action1/sync-step') ?>" data-reload="1" action="<?= $link('/addons/action1/sync-step') ?>"><?= $csrf ?><input type="hidden" name="mapping_id" value="<?= $e($mapping['id']) ?>"><button class="button small secondary" <?= !$settings['enabled']||!$curlAvailable?'disabled':'' ?>>Resume sync</button></form><?php endif; ?><?php endif; ?><form method="post" action="<?= $link('/addons/action1/map') ?>"><?= $csrf ?><input type="hidden" name="external_organization_id" value="<?= $e($mapping['external_organization_id']) ?>"><input type="hidden" name="organization_id" value="<?= $e($mapping['organization_id']) ?>"><input type="hidden" name="active" value="<?= $mapping['active']?'0':'1' ?>"><button class="text-link" <?= !$settings['enabled']?'disabled':'' ?>><?= $mapping['active']?'Disable mapping':'Enable mapping' ?></button></form></td></tr><?php endforeach; ?></tbody></table></div><?php endif; ?></section>
